{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46165","headline":"中秋十五夜月 · 贯休","name":"中秋十五夜月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"噀雪喷霜满碧虚，王孙公子翫相呼。\n从来天匠爲轮足，自是人心此夜余。\n静入万家危露滴，清埋衆象呌鸿孤。\n坐来惟觉情无极，何况三湘与五湖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46165.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46165","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}